WEBVTT

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.860
Run! If that rain gets on you, it's over!

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.400
Meg!

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.740
Meg! Are you all right!?

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.740
Tim! Hurry!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Grab hold!

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.810
Tim!

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.090
Transformation!?

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.960
Tim is... Tim is...

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.090
Strange...

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:43.430
I'm not afraid of anything anymore.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.420
Tim!

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.100
It's finally begun!

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.970
Yeah.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:00.880
Awright! Let's go!

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:07.390
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:14.290
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:33.680
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:40.020
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:46.360
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:52.700
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:59.210
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:05.210
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:08.710
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:18.710
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.080
There's been no response
from the flying object.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.080
Please order an attack!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.070
We have no choice...

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.750
Target confirmed. Formation 05.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:49.760
Maintain your positions!
We'll aim at its head.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.420
Roger! Locked on target!

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:56.590
"Cat in Paradise"

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.060
What are you thinking?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.400
It's not about what's
outside this paradise, is it?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.070
I...

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:44.270
That is a sin. Now look...

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.080
No!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.950
See? Even over here...

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.150
No!!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:14.370
Those poisonous snakes are trying
to drag you out of this paradise,

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.810
and take you back to the sullied world.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:25.720
You must destroy them. Or it is
the end for you and paradise.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.690
Me?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:32.890
Wh- what's happening? What's going on!?

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.740
Magnificent! Eve, keep it up!

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.270
Bring down all who try
to invade our paradise!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:05.020
What!? You're saying Eve's doing all that?

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:09.030
Eve is putting everything she has
learned up to this point to use.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:13.930
But... I never taught Eve how
to bring down armed helicopters!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.640
Was that it?

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.670
What!? He is...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.720
Relax. I don't plan to fight you guys.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:37.060
More importantly, you're heading
to that monster thing, right?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:42.060
What!? Your friend was
swallowed up by that thing!?

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:45.060
I... couldn't protect Tim.

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.360
Tim!?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.740
Dammit!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:57.080
Eden will continue to grow
by absorbing life energy.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.750
In time, it will swallow up all of mankind,

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:03.020
and totally cover this planet.

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:10.690
A self-propagating machine with
immortal life and infinite capacity...

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:13.690
But Eden is still in its infancy.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:17.360
What!? No way! That thing
is still an infant!?

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:23.040
Yes, if it swallows up more and
more people and increases its power...

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.700
it will be beyond our powers.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.040
No!

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.040
Then what do you do?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:34.380
Separating Eve from Eden before
they completely merge is the only way...

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:37.050
Eve? Did something happen to her?

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:40.390
Eve is inside that thing.

00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:45.020
If it's as I designed it,
Eve has been taken into the receptor.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:54.070
Sheesh... Awfully relaxed, aren't you!?
You even brought food!

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:59.740
C'mon! It's like they say,
you can't fight in an empty stomach.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.300
Right?

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.470
Don't they?

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.680
So, the question is how we attack it...

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.690
Eden is showering nanomachines...

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.690
In other words, we can't attack from below.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:20.360
But to attack from the sky...

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:23.360
We'd be cut into pieces
with that sickle-like thing...

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.700
It will be difficult
to stop that nano-slicer.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.700
The only way is to create a blind spot...

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:34.370
Or lure it to a small area
and run it aground?

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:35.710
How?

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.710
We're at the end of our rope...

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:40.080
Isn't there something we can do?

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:46.390
How does Eden detect people?

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:50.150
It's not as though it's spreading
nanomachines at random, right?

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:58.400
Eden detects humans'
mental activities through Eve,

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:01.000
and moves towards areas
where it senses a high response.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.000
So that's why it targets cities.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.100
Then the place Eden will target next is...

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:12.010
Palmila City...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:16.680
Then, it means that we have to take care
of it before it gets there or it's over.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.020
If it's in the middle of the desert,
where no humans are around,

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.690
even a small number of people
may be able to lure Eden.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.180
That's it!

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:29.360
Now, the question is,
where are we going to lure Eden?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.360
If we are to run it aground,

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.490
it should be between cliffs?

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.700
Oh, let's just move forward for now.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.260
We've already chowed down, so...

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.710
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.380
I asked Charden-<i>san</i> to join me!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.250
It has been a while...

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:05.060
Since that time, I've continued on
my journey in search of a path to follow.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.670
That's right...

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:15.340
What's more important than me right now
is what to do with that monstrosity.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.340
This is the place...

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.680
To the southwest of Palmila City...

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.680
there is a ravine created
over time by weathering.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.680
If we lure it here...

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:30.360
Sheesh! How are we gonna make
that huge thing change its course!?

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:33.690
Eve's consciousness shouldn't
be completely gone yet.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.700
Eden will react to whatever Eve likes.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:40.700
Whatever Eve likes... whatever Eve likes...

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.030
Isn't there something!?

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:46.040
When you think of princess,
you think of omelets! Charred black ones!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.040
And I love mango pudding!

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.710
Young girls love fruit parfaits.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.040
Grilled octopus in batter?

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:53.380
Hamburgers?

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.050
Poached tofu?

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.380
Sven...

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:59.380
No!! It's nothing like that!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:01.390
When you think of Eve,
you think of books, right!?

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:05.060
"The Bond Between A Husband and Wife",
"101 Wild Elephants on the Stampede!"

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:08.390
"Camels' Humps", "<i>Tagaya"...</i>

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.400
Fireworks!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.400
--Fireworks!?
--Fireworks!?
--Fireworks!?

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:17.070
Right! Fireworks!

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:20.410
Eve likes the fireworks at festival time!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:23.070
We'll shoot up lots and lots of fireworks
and get Eve's attention!

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:25.080
Fireworks?

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:29.040
We won't find fireworks
in the middle of a desert like this.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.420
Hey! Where're you going!?

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:35.750
To the fireworks factory in town!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.760
You guys go on ahead,
I'll catch up right away!

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:39.760
Leon!

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.760
--Leon!
--Leon!
--Leon!

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.430
You fool!

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.560
If the nanomachine rain gets on you,
you'll be swallowed up, too!

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.050
I hate sand!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.570
Damn, that kid!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:30.410
Well, Train?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:32.570
See the kid?

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.750
--Nope.
--♪ La la... ♪

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.420
I see...

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.760
Gotcha!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.320
Leon...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.430
Eden is!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.430
What the hell is that!?

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:57.440
Eden has turned into a woman...

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.770
So pretty...

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:01.370
The second form of Eden...

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.710
What?

00:12:02.710 --> 00:12:05.710
By absorbing the people in Kashmir City,

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.710
the bond between Eden and Eve
has grown stronger.

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.580
Oh, no!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:17.720
Once it reaches Palmila City, no one will
be able to stop Eden and Eve from merging.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.720
We must hurry!

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:22.390
Dammit, where's the fireworks!?

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:24.730
He's definitely taking too long.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.400
There's no point
in placing our hopes on a kid.

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.170
He may have been
an Apostle of the Stars once,

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.740
but he's still just a kid.

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:35.070
I wonder if he got
rained on by nanomachines

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:37.410
and was swallowed up by Eden...

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:39.040
Hey!

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.080
--Oweee!
--Hey! Stop it!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.110
--My bad! My bad! I'm sorry!
--Hey! Stop it!

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:55.090
That kid... isn't too shabby, it seems...

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:56.120
Huh?

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.700
--Kuro-<i>sama</i>!
--Train!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.690
Wait for me!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.370
That's reckless! Come back! Train!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.040
Don't worry!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:12.340
Eden has left Kashmir City!
The rain will stop soon!

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:19.380
All... who... invade... paradise...

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.120
will be... dealt with.

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:30.400
Well, you can't have this!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.060
Dammit!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.800
Kid, you're not bad at all.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.710
What's the speed of the enemy?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.710
It's still going
at about 100 km per hour.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.380
It'll be over if we fall behind...

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.050
The road conditions are awful.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.050
It's a life-or-death rally, huh?

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:31.060
Awright... I'm all fired up!

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:34.390
Once Eden runs aground, we will go in.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.060
Then let us wish each other success...

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:40.060
and also that we will meet again alive.

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.860
--Right!
--Right!
--Right!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.410
Are you tired, Eve?

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.750
But it's just a little more.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:56.540
We're going to an even more fun place next.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:03.150
A place... that's even... more fun...

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.710
No, not that way!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.380
Let's go to an even more fun place!

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:29.370
Hey! Eve!

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.390
Awright!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:37.390
Just like someone said,
it's reacting to the fireworks!

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.720
Aghh! It's headed this way!

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:43.920
Awright! Let's make a big show!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:48.730
I have permission
from Kuro-<i>sama</i> just for today...

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.400
So I'm going to blow a lot of fire!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.740
<i>Tamaya</i>!

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:13.660
<i>Tamaya</i>! <i>Tamaya</i>! <i>Tamaya</i>!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.030
What's going on?

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:21.370
Eden has changed its course!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:26.370
The Sweepers...
Rather, it's the work of small fries.

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:27.710
It doesn't matter!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:31.040
Put it back on course
for Palmila City immediately.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:32.980
I understand.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.040
<i>Tamaya</i>!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:49.790
Now... come with me to
an even more fun place, Eve.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:57.400
Leave them to me and keep
shooting up fireworks!

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:03.010
Drat! That thing's turning around!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.170
Shoot up more fireworks!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:11.350
Aww... Looks like it's going away!

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:13.020
Hey! Don't give up!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.510
Boooo!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:22.750
This is bad, Sephiria! Eden is
turning back towards Palmila City.

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.730
Hey Train! What're you up to!?

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:32.040
--Go, Mister!
--Aghhh!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.040
--You're so cool!
--Stop it!!

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.370
Hang on tight!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.040
Let's go!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:57.060
Hey! Princess!

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:59.730
Come on over this way!

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:03.930
Eve! Come back!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.680
What's wrong, Eve?

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:14.010
Eve! I was wrong!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:16.680
I'll never tell you to go
to a boarding school again!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:19.550
Th- this is!

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:27.690
You don't have to go to school!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:31.560
We'll always be together!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:43.640
All right! It's coming this way!

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.810
Whee!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:26.020
--Yeah!!
--Yeah!!
--Yeah!!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.350
Awright! Let's attack!

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.690
--Right!
--Right!
--Right!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.360
Kaboom!

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:33.260
We will go in, too!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:48.040
Fight with all your strength...
in accordance with your beliefs!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.370
Very well!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:51.570
Let us wish each other success...

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:58.720
Rins-<i>chan</i>! When I return,
I will give you a big, long hug!

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:00.720
Wow! He's gonna marry you!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.720
Wedding! Wedding!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.390
Tan tan tatan!

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.390
Jenos!

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.550
I'll punch you in the face when you return!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.740
Small fries... this is your idea of a trap!?

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.410
I have no choice...

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:29.750
I shall show you small fries,
the true power of Eden!

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:32.240
The real power of Tao!

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.760
Now you shall witness...

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:44.160
the infinite life energy that I discovered!

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:04.380
What!?

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.540
We're already in a pinch!?

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:14.220
Now go, Zero Numbers!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:28.070
Heartnet, leave this place to us...

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:29.440
and go!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.080
Go, XIII!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.420
Mademoiselle Eve is waiting!

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:41.250
I owe you!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.420
The sin of betrayal...

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:47.090
you shall pay for it now!

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:50.030
Damn! They're here again!

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.730
I shall assist!

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:57.990
I'm counting on you!

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.040
Awright!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.040
Each one of you...

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:06.570
don't you dare die!!

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:21.390
<i>Since your new black boots</i>
<i>caused a blister,</i>

00:22:21.390 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>you rest your right foot</i>

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:38.400
<i>We'll keep walking along</i>
<i>with our own rhythm, without rushing</i>

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:51.910
<i>Don't say anything</i>
<i>because we'll soon understand each other</i>

00:22:56.460 --> 00:23:06.460
<i>I'm just holding you now to keep you warm</i>

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:20.710
<i>I'm completely wrapped around you, so...</i>

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:31.120
<i>Quietly the powder-like snow</i>
<i>is building up...</i>

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:41.400
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:43.470
<i>I've finally made it this far...</i>
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:44.070
